00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.329
not even know what eSports are.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.720
Whereas the city council and the mayor of the city of Huntsville,

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:25.640
Alabama wish to recognize the outstanding accomplishments of the University

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:29.679
of Alabama in Huntsville UAH eSports and its student athletes for their

00:05:29.679 --> 00:05:35.200
exceptional performances during the 2025-2026 competitive eSports season.

00:05:35.709 --> 00:05:40.720
And whereas UAH eSports competed in the National eSports Collegiate Conference

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:45.350
NECC, one of the nation's premier collegiate e-Sports organizations,

00:05:45.429 --> 00:05:51.970
and demonstrated remarkable success this season with 9 of its 27 teams qualifying

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:53.690
for the national tournament.

00:05:54.109 --> 00:05:58.630
And whereas 4 UAH eSports teams advanced to the deepest stages of their

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:02.470
respective national playoff brackets, showcasing the program's talent,

00:06:02.589 --> 00:06:05.329
dedication, and teamwork on a national stage.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:11.899
And whereas UAH's Valorant Blue team captured the NECC national championship

00:06:11.899 --> 00:06:16.459
on May 4th following an already impressive season in which the team also

00:06:16.459 --> 00:06:21.059
secured a regional championship victory, further establishing itself among

00:06:21.059 --> 00:06:24.100
the nation's elegiate collegiate eSports.

00:06:24.279 --> 00:06:30.649
Teams and whereas UAH's Marvel rivals Blue team earned a place among the

00:06:30.649 --> 00:06:35.829
top competitors nationally advancing to compete against California State

00:06:35.829 --> 00:06:40.250
University Sacramento for 3rd place in the national tournament bracket after

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.799
finishing 4th in the regional playoff competition,

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:49.470
whereas UAH's CounterStrike White team advanced to compete for an NECC national

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:53.329
championship title after also earning a regional championship victory earlier

00:06:53.329 --> 00:06:53.950
in the year.

00:06:55.579 --> 00:06:56.170
There's more.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:02.109
Whereas UAH's League of Legends blue team also won a regional championship

00:07:02.109 --> 00:07:07.700
title in the 2025 season, and whereas within the UAH eSports team program,

00:07:07.829 --> 00:07:11.489
blue teams represent varsity level competition and white teams represent

00:07:11.489 --> 00:07:12.910
junior varsity level competition.

00:07:13.375 --> 00:07:18.204
And the success achieved by both levels of teams reflects the continued

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:21.924
growth and national prominence of eSports at the University of Alabama in

00:07:21.924 --> 00:07:22.285
Huntsville.

00:07:22.325 --> 00:07:25.605
