00:07:33.839 --> 00:07:37.779
immense appreciation to the pride and distinction these teams have brought

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:42.559
to the university and the Huntsville community during their commitment at

00:07:42.559 --> 00:07:45.320
sportsmanship, and competitive excellence.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:48.600
